etail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22num%22%3A4%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1668332653517\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/01/17/6100274/2875379e8dee52da04331af8ec3c44ba_8867157414739730063.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">414</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">39</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">作为星辰之力浇筑而成的武装，这把镰刀部分继承了圣剑「幽兰黛尔」的力量。它既能释放出恒星喷流般的烈焰，又能够在刃端裁切空间，扫除周遭的一切阻碍——正如美神阿弗洛狄忒一般多才多艺。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">伽马射线暴</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:16秒]引动星阵范围内的地火喷射并爆炸，对范围内敌人造成1200%+200%的火焰元素伤害，并对命中目标附加【炎燎】，持续10秒，【炎燎】状态下，受到火焰元素伤害提升20.0%。缭乱星棘使用该武器时，【星焰】命中【炎燎】目标时，额外对目标造成15%攻击力的火焰属性伤害</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">中子简并态</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">持有该武器的角色普通攻击（包括蓄力和分支）对【炎燎】状态目标造成全伤害提升25.0%</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">缭乱星棘装备时，在场下时，每秒回复星能20点</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">相对论性喷流</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">蓄力攻击全伤害提升20.0%，缭乱星棘装备时，释放蓄力攻击或必杀技后，提升自身25.0%的火焰元素伤害持续10秒，且在此期间造成普通攻击（包括蓄力和分支）伤害时，可对命中目标附加【炎燎】，持续10秒</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1458/detail\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/01/27/50494840/aee4be0fa6656d84c6c004494f6c685f_1286977319893016157.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「星刃 白矮星」图鉴后任意镰刀蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div c